{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一名女子在將軍澳過馬路，懷疑被車撞倒昏迷送院。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">現場是寶琳北路近寶林消防局對開，涉事私家車意外後停在路邊，車頭凹陷。警方稱晚上約八時半接報，一名29歲女子過馬路期間，在寳林消防局對開被駛至的私家車撞倒。期間一輛小巴懷疑收掣不及撞向私家車。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.TA.TKO-2230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026lJmoxOiDtX1788275807.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TA.TKO-2230_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">女子昏迷送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。私家車男司機報稱頭痛、即場治理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T15:38:41.449014+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}